<Base title="Home" description="GEAR Moto Foundation is building access to motorcycle safety gear, rider education, and recovery support."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-in"><img class="hero-logo" src="/images/Gear_Logo_White.png" alt="GEAR Moto Foundation"/><div class="eyebrow">Protect the Ride. Support the Rider.</div><h1><span>Gear Up.</span><span>Train Smart.</span><span class="accent">Recover Strong.</span></h1><p>Building a stronger riding community through access to essential safety gear, rider education, and practical support when the unexpected happens.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/programs/">Explore Our Programs</a><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Get Involved</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#ba1739">Our Purpose</div><h2>More Than a Ride.<br/>A Community.</h2><p class="lede">We believe motorcycle safety and support shouldn't end when the engine shuts off. Our programs are being developed to help riders prepare, train, and recover.</p></div></section><section class="section" style="background:#fafbfc"><div class="wrap"><h2>Three Ways to Make a Difference.</h2><div class="cards"><article class="card"><img src="/images/Gear_G.png" alt=""/><h3>Safety Gear</h3><p>Reducing financial barriers to protective motorcycle equipment.</p></article><article class="card"><img src="/images/Gear_E.png" alt=""/><h3>Rider Education</h3><p>Improving access to motorcycle skills training and endorsement courses.</p></article><article class="card"><img src="/images/Gear_R.png" alt=""/><h3>Recovery Support</h3><p>Developing responsible assistance for qualifying accident-related medical costs.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><img class="dark-logo" src="/images/Gear_Logo_White.png" alt="GEAR Moto Foundation"/><h2>Better Prepared.<br/>Stronger Together.</h2><p class="lede">Our foundation is developing community events, partnerships, and sustainable rider assistance. Learn how you can help shape what comes next.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/contact/">Explore Partnerships</a></div></div></section><div class="notice">Foundation programs are in development; assistance applications and online donations are not currently open.</div></Base>
